From 3ba0f711642a888aec92a611a3f3b2211157ff89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] usage-ring: skip plugin startup in in-process facade

The pinned public facade does not expose PluginStartupTasks in
InProcessStartArgs. Usage Ring's runtime must not initialize plugin discovery
or subprocess hosts, even when a hostile config or plugin directory exists.

--- a/codex-rs/app-server/src/in_process.rs
+++ b/codex-rs/app-server/src/in_process.rs
@@ -479 +479 @@
-                plugin_startup_tasks: crate::PluginStartupTasks::Start,
+                plugin_startup_tasks: crate::PluginStartupTasks::Skip,
